# Words of Folders' earlier copies: looking at older versions of a file or folder, things deleted from a folder, and putting them back.

folders-earlier-shut = Nothing in an earlier copy can be changed. Copy things out of it to keep them.
folders-earlier-day-words =
    { $day ->
        [today] today at { $time }
        [yesterday] yesterday at { $time }
       *[other] { $date } at { $time }
    }
folders-earlier-day-line =
    { $day ->
        [today] Today at { $time }
        [yesterday] Yesterday at { $time }
       *[other] { $date } at { $time }
    }
folders-earlier-note-dated = An earlier copy, as it was { $when }. Nothing in it can be changed: copy things out of it to keep them.
folders-earlier-note = An earlier copy. Nothing in it can be changed: copy things out of it to keep them.
folders-earlier-tab-name = Earlier: { $name }
folders-earlier-undo-put-back = Undo putting back { $name }
folders-earlier-put-back-kept = Put back. The one that was there is kept beside it.
folders-earlier-put-back = Put back where it was.
folders-earlier-same = It holds the same as the one there now.
folders-earlier-differs = It differs from the one there now.
folders-earlier-compare-failed = They could not be compared: { $why }
folders-earlier-menu-versions = Earlier versions
folders-earlier-menu-deleted = Things deleted from here
folders-earlier-versions-title = Earlier versions of { $name }
folders-earlier-versions-none = No earlier copy of it differs from the one there now.
folders-earlier-versions-foot = Putting one back keeps the one there now beside it, and Undo takes the step back.
folders-earlier-deleted-title = Things deleted from { $name }
folders-earlier-deleted-none = Nothing that was in this folder in an earlier copy is missing from it now.
folders-earlier-deleted-foot = Putting one back returns it to this folder, and Undo takes the step back.
folders-earlier-folder-then = The folder as it was then
folders-earlier-version-line = { $size }, from the copy of { $date }
folders-earlier-deleted-folder-line = A folder, last kept { $when }
folders-earlier-deleted-line = { $size }, last kept { $when }
folders-earlier-working = Working…
folders-earlier-open-folder-tip = Open that day's folder in a new tab, to look at
folders-earlier-open-tip = Open it to look at
folders-earlier-put-back-tip = Put it back
folders-earlier-compare-tip = Read both through and say whether they hold the same
